[{"title":"横山 其五","author":"刘倓","text":"石镜当年始发祥，皎如秋月弄寒光。\n山川精彩无人识，付与樵夫敲斲伤。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34442,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"横山 其三","author":"刘倓","text":"五更一霎清明雨，晓雾梨花梦白云。\n半岭肩舆犹兀兀，一杯卯酒尚曛曛。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34443,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"横山 其四","author":"刘倓","text":"大小万竹望不见，上下牢岩过若飞。\n红缀舞衣山踯躅，白裁玉版野蔷薇。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34444,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"横山 其一","author":"刘倓","text":"桐林老子俗情无，览胜探奇不觉晡。\n幸尔清溪好明月，如行四十里冰壶。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34445,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"横山 其二","author":"刘倓","text":"一溪径险仆夫劬，三酌油油醉笋舆。\n隔岸火焱三四点，不知谁照夜滩鱼。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34446,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"次韵胡少瀹题梁王山蟠松诗","author":"刘倓","text":"长松上捎日月宫，昂霄耸壑材甚雄。\n不肯甘心卧云巘，有时见梦十八公。\n汗颜血指，那知大匠自有体。\n斩伐丁丁，朝夕聒人幽耳聋。\n岂如吾乡华顶一峰八万四千丈，下蟠夭夭矫矫奇奇怪怪之苍松。\n樛枝半压鲁隐九年之大雪，雅韵曾和虞氏五弦之薰风。\n八千灵椿三千桃实几番见，何况篱下黄菊江头赤叶枫。\n萧梁劫火烧不死，坐阅五季鹿走天下人亡弓。\n世人欲识吾家所扰真龙种，请看春雷发蛰雾滃霱云从。\n礧砢蹙缩轮囷拥肿可挫不可辱，坚刚正独盘薄偃蹇受命不受封。\n无用之用不器之器振古成自晚，天台道人何苦汲汲图象寄涪翁。\n搜肠镂肾状出怪松赞，反言挺而茂者肥瘠贵得中。\n吁嗟九原相如不可作，飘飘词赋谁摩穹。\n阆风逸民自愧才力薄，北斗以南惟有四朝之老农。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34447,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"茧㯃花","author":"刘倓","text":"清晨步上金鸡岭，极目漫山茧㯃花。\n雪蕊琼丝亦堪赏，樵童蚕妇伐归家。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34448,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"句 其二","author":"刘倓","text":"粗官差入党侯帐，精品平收陆羽经。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34449,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"步瀛桥乐章","author":"胡次焱","text":"跨海虹霓浸不收，植楹鲵背耸于楼。\n直通两岸东西路，横截一溪上下流。\n网罗学士唐天子，管领英雄张状头。\n醉墨淋漓题柱上，与君从此步瀛洲。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34450,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乙酉夏述怀二绝 其二","author":"刘宰","text":"岸柳风摧更绿饶，槛花当暑自红娇。\n流行一气元无息，松柏何妨独后彫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34451,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"乙酉夏述怀二绝 其一","author":"刘宰","text":"水边舟子竞招招，陌上车尘晚更嚣。\n祇有幽人无个事，藕花深处弄轻桡。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34452,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"刘宰","text":"天孙今夕渡银潢，女伴纷纷乞巧忙。\n乞得巧多成底事，祇堪装点嫁衣裳。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34453,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日","author":"刘宰","text":"捣餈篘酒荐新舂，叹息年来甔石空。\n不惜解衣供一饷，要令稚子识家风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34454,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"九日送酒黄竹涧","author":"刘宰","text":"老瓦盆中渌酒香，田家风物近重阳。\n不知竹涧槃桓处，今赋黄华第几章。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34455,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"口占谢陈使君","author":"刘宰","text":"相思目断鉴湖船，书别殷勤敢赠言。\n未解终南寻捷径，少宽谷口截朱辕。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34456,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为土山行者劝缘","author":"刘宰","text":"莫言山势但陂陁，坐断东南万顷波。\n地胜要人勤洒扫，瓶空无米却如何。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34457,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"为纪生借屋","author":"刘宰","text":"乃祖焚身为祖刘，末孙那敢不相周。\n单辞往扣贤公子，茅屋何妨得借留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34458,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书汤兄诗卷后并呈丹阳大夫三首 其三","author":"刘宰","text":"长安未必胜江湖，盖世功名徯大儒。\n三事更应登密令，一廛我欲伴樵夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34459,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书汤兄诗卷后并呈丹阳大夫三首 其二","author":"刘宰","text":"令尹胸襟隘五湖，狂言时肯听迂儒。\n未知他日翘材馆，可著当年郑介夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34460,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书汤兄诗卷后并呈丹阳大夫三首 其一","author":"刘宰","text":"明月韬光甓社湖，发挥千载赖耆儒。\n清江曲就无人识，来往横塘一鄙夫。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34461,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"书陈少阳遗墨后","author":"刘宰","text":"赎死何由可百身，遗书犹足警来人。\n当时珍重千金字，此日凄凉一窖尘。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34462,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云边即事","author":"刘宰","text":"山鸟纷纷不计名，晓来聒聒弄新晴。\n山人不识虞庭乐，疑是箫韶奏九成。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34463,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云边阻雨 其二","author":"刘宰","text":"蔷薇篱落送春阑，笋葚园林早夏间。\n牛背牧儿酣午梦，不知风雨过前山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34464,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云边阻雨 其一","author":"刘宰","text":"辗转无眠到夜阑，鹊声送喜近檐间。\n好风吹断夜来雨，晴日放开云外山。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34465,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云边种松","author":"刘宰","text":"渐止牛羊牧，还添雨露滋。\n但令萌檗长，自有岁寒姿。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34466,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云边遣兴","author":"刘宰","text":"泄云日日冒山头，古涧淙淙咽怒流。\n但得农家馀雨泽，不妨客子叹淹留。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34467,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"云边遣兴","author":"刘宰","text":"穴处堪忘世，松餐足永年。\n有时云雨止，独立看青天。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34468,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"天台道中用陈氏园亭韵 其二","author":"刘宰","text":"亭俯澄波对碧山，山头古木总苍颜。\n爱山未办还山计，猿鹤还应伴我閒。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34469,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东西冈诸李谋复宏词墓","author":"刘宰","text":"前朝流派日星明，圣代殊科更策名。\n遗骨未寒丘垄废，可能宗党不关情。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34470,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"东阳道中闻杜鹃","author":"刘宰","text":"万里云山路渺茫，车轮竟日往来忙。\n凭君一语成归去，笑杀儿时射四方。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34471,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代柬苏佥","author":"刘宰","text":"七十收身古战场，归来八十更康强。\n酒阑庭户秋光好，想见诗成一缕香。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34472,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代柬促陈居士归","author":"刘宰","text":"一棹东游久未归，羞囊应已典春衣。\n淡烟疏柳鲈鱼市，底事流涎对落晖。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34473,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代柬寄王去非","author":"刘宰","text":"闻随使节过江东，想见旌旗十里红。\n多少苍生在寒谷，早吹邹律转春风。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34474,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代柬答徐监押","author":"刘宰","text":"隋堤绿柳漾清流，画舸输君烂漫游。\n柘荡高湖须老伴，不妨捩柁出湾头。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34475,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代柬谢袁兄","author":"刘宰","text":"渔樵并舍两相忘，三径回看久就荒。\n只有生平真活计，湖光万顷接山光。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34476,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代挽赵工侍汤氏令人三首 其三","author":"刘宰","text":"白莲塘下成新滟，绿柳堤边散密阴。\n精舍拂云松柏缭，死生何地不娱心。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_1.csv","pointer":34477,"sha256":"18413bf73b9d113baa963a97950b84db1032d48e773bb7501dd506c738b4292a","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"代挽赵工侍汤氏令人三首 其二","author":"刘宰","text":"西湖野树上林花，行乐谁知大尹家。\n帘幕垂垂人兀坐，金猊香散日西斜。","collection":"宋","notice":